      {
        "quote": "Halloween: The Game isn’t my favorite of the IP-based asymmetrical horror games, but it’s still a good one. Sure, it’s got some janky animations and can be a bit overfamiliar at times, but these games, like their movie inspirations, are enjoyable despite their flaws. For me, the fun varies greatly based on the crew you’re playing with and how you interact with each other. It’s releasing right in time for spooky season, and it’s one I’m excited to play with some friends as part of our Halloween festivities. ",
